# ABP Settings

## Defining Settings
```csharp
public class MySettingDefinitionProvider : SettingDefinitionProvider
{
    public override void Define(ISettingDefinitionContext context)
    {
        context.Add(
            new SettingDefinition("MyApp.MaxItemCount", "10"),
            new SettingDefinition("MyApp.EnableFeature", "false"),
            new SettingDefinition("MyApp.SecretKey", isEncrypted: true)
        );
    }
}
```

## Reading Settings
```csharp
public class MyService : ITransientDependency
{
    private readonly ISettingProvider _settingProvider;

    public async Task DoSomethingAsync()
    {
        var maxCount = await _settingProvider.GetAsync<int>("MyApp.MaxItemCount");
        var isEnabled = await _settingProvider.IsTrueAsync("MyApp.EnableFeature");
    }
}
```

## Setting Value Providers (Order)
1. `DefaultValueSettingValueProvider` - Default from definition
2. `ConfigurationSettingValueProvider` - From appsettings.json
3. `GlobalSettingValueProvider` - System-wide
4. `TenantSettingValueProvider` - Per tenant
5. `UserSettingValueProvider` - Per user

## Configuration in appsettings.json
```json
{
  "Settings": {
    "MyApp.MaxItemCount": "20",
    "MyApp.EnableFeature": "true"
  }
}
```

## Setting Properties
- `Name`: Unique identifier
- `DefaultValue`: Fallback value
- `DisplayName`: Localizable name for UI
- `IsVisibleToClients`: Expose to client-side
- `IsEncrypted`: Encrypt in database
